SUMMARY:SUN KINGS – ACOUSTIC DUO
DESCRIPTION:OUTDOOR SUNSET SERIES with SUN KINGS ACOUSTIC DUO\nSongs of Lennon and McCartney features Drew Harrison and Scott Southard\, the voices of Lennon & McCartney in one of America’s favorite and critically acclaimed Beatles tribute groups. A pair of top-notch singer/songwriters in their own write\, Drew & Scott share in acoustic performance their passion for the music of The Beatles\, and the John & Paul singing and writing partnership.
URL:https://ranchonicasio.com/event/sun-kings-acoustic-duo-2/
