SUMMARY:PARDON THE INTERRUPTION
DESCRIPTION:Dinner Show with PARDON THE INTERRUPTION.\nRoaring out of the fog-shrouded hills of Sonoma and drowning out the chatter\, New Wave/Prog-Pop troubadours Pardon the Interruption (aka PTI) are taking their place — asserting their voice — in the storied musical conversation of the San Francisco Bay Area.
