SUMMARY:SHA NA NOW
DESCRIPTION:DINNER SHOW WITH SHA NA NOW\nA tribute to legendary Sha Na Na!\nSha Na Now celebrates the best of the best classic rock-n-roll music from the 50’s and 60’s. With front man Frankie Adel – former lead singer from Sha Na Na – bringing his dynamic stage presence\, this band will keep you dancing all night long.  Members’ collective experience includes working with some of music’s greats such as: Celine Dion\, Hall & Oates\, Huey Lewis\, Beach Boys\, Paul Anka\, Kenny Rogers and more.  You will be amazed to remember just how great this music from Rock’s golden age was\, and is!
